<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 267 0 R
/E (Papel Verde is a web application developed for the management and sale of books, comics and mangas. The platform allows users to register, log in, view products, add items to cart and manage favorites. In addition, it has an administration panel for managing users and products. The project has been developed using PHP, MySQL, HTML, CSS, Bootstrap and JavaScript following an MVC architecture. The final result is a functional application aimed at electronic commerce of cultural products.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
